      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "iOS Shortcuts' \"Open URL\" action silently strips long query parameter values, making it impossible to pass the HTML payload directly in the URL; solved via a two-step KV-store relay (POST /preview -> token -> ?preview=TOKEN, ~80 chars) that survives iOS's limit."
